    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/5/45963.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 1,
    "turn_text": "I would say that there's not one priority. There's numerous priorities. One, I would like to see navigational aids put in for the transit vessels that are international vessels that's not there now. Establishing through the Maritime Association Organization, universally, channels. I like to see a communication system put in where everybody's immediate contact with all types of activities. And of course, I want to build a port.",
