    "turn_text": "Well, again, we don't have any facilities up there of any consequence. We need to build a port that can take deep draft vessels. We need a Coast Guard station in the Arctic. We have a great one in Kodiak, but we need an Arctic Coast Guard station. And we need to get, I would say, some of the newer cutters built up there, and plus the ice breakers, which we hope to get.",
